            <tr><td class="band">New charges by card member</td><td>Read in per member so you can tell whose charge is whose</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="band">Account summary</td><td>Used as the printed total the export reconciles against</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="band">Fees and interest, year to date</td><td>Kept as statement-level detail and an extra check</td></tr>
