          <li>IRS, <a href="https://www.irs.gov/publications/p463" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Publication 463</a> (documentary evidence: vendor name, date, amount; $75 threshold) and <a href="https://www.irs.gov/publications/p583" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Publication 583</a> (proof of payment alone does not establish a deduction).</li>
